----------- Comments to Authors -----------
- The literature review requires updating. Just two references between 2023 & 2026, and one of them is from a Python library for optimization.
- Eq. 4, please describe all of its elements. The same check applies to all equations.
- Instead of Figure 1, a detailed pseudocode would be more suitable for the sake of reproducing the results.
- Why not add convergence graphs to analyze the online behavior of the different versions tested?
- Comparing against a baseline is OK, but comparing against the state-of-the-art must be considered.
- Instead of using the Wilcoxon signed-rank (sensitive to the sample order), the rank-sum version must be adopted.
- Why not consider different dimensionalities in the experiments?
